        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Dull, constant left testicular/hemiscrotal ache for 3/7, rated 4–5/10; worse standing or walking and better lying down with supportive underwear; patient says it “tracks along the tube at the back like the epididymis”"
      }
    },
